# Import pipeline

When continuing the EN import, launching writers/critics, or closing a lot,
read [import/AGENT_PLAYBOOK.md](../../import/AGENT_PLAYBOOK.md) first.

Source `.apkg`: `import/WSET_Level_3_--_NEW.apkg` (gitignored). Not Downloads.

- Parent only: ledger via `re.subn`, `status: reviewed`, `make check`, one
  commit per chapter-lot. Never `ProgressStore.save()`.
- Writers: one `cards/cNN-*.yaml` each. No `progress.yaml`. No commit.
- Critics: read-only. Fixer then re-critic until ACCEPT_ALL (HOLD may remain).
  Fail joke / impossible distractors, a keyed choice that is obviously
  the longest, and empty French even when the fact is right.
- Max 6–8 parallel writers, one file each. Lot ≤ 50 source notes.
- No `fr:` until every published chapter is 0 pending. Skip `c00` unless asked.
  A human may override. FR critic = sense + credibility (playbook Phase 2).
